{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_15010360:1:1","lang":"en","texts":{"menu:10051930:1":{"text":"Do we really have to clear out that house...?","source_cn":"我们必须要清理那间屋子吗……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"},"say:2:1536032001:0":{"text":"That house. The one I'm pointing at...","source_cn":"就是……就是那间房子。对，就是我手指的那间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAE95E69E4CCF4A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1536032002:0":{"text":"The moment I got close and smelled that rot... I knew something was wrong... But I didn't expect it to be so... so...","source_cn":"刚凑近点，闻到一股子奇怪的腐臭味的时候，我就知道没好事...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x682689210A149F6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536032003:0":{"text":"The whole place was full of bodies. Soldiers... not a single one was whole. Some were torn apart. Some had been... eaten.","source_cn":"里面全都是其他士兵的……尸体，可没有一具是完整的。有的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0690CD75C1ABA0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1536032004:0":{"text":"One was slumped by the door... holding handfuls of bug eggs...","source_cn":"有个靠着门死的士兵，他的怀里……怀里还抱着无数的虫卵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166480F78025F645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1536032005:1":{"text":"Stop... please stop—ugh...","source_cn":"快、快别说了……呕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28C4361017AD6084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:menu:10051930:0":{"text":"What did you see?","male":"What did you see?","female":"What did you see?","source_cn":"你们看见什么了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","variant_male_record_index":"273111","variant_female_record_index":"273113"},"say:1:1536033001:1":{"text":"Now that the locusts are out of the way, people can finally come home. But we need to clear the place first.","source_cn":"是啊，那些针蝗消失了，这些村庄陆陆续续也得清理出来，准...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA03FAB7C36AF113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1536033002:0":{"text":"To be honest, we knew things would be bad when we got here.","source_cn":"说实话，我们来之前就预想过，村庄内的状况一定不怎么好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40BCA0ABD71FDC4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1536033003:1":{"text":"But we didn't expect this...","source_cn":"但没想到，竟然会有如此惨状……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8C472ED9815F89A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536033004:1":{"text":"And now... we have to tell their families what happened... How do we even begin?","source_cn":"哎，后续我们还要与死者的亲属交代情况。这……我们可怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0201BFFD1E7B54D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:menu:10051930:1":{"text":"Clear out the house?","male":"Clear out the house?","female":"Clear out the house?","source_cn":"清理房屋？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","variant_male_record_index":"273112","variant_female_record_index":"273114"}},"speakers":{"speaker:士兵戴克里":{"text":"Dakri","source":"士兵戴克里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:士兵艾奇":{"text":"Ekko","source":"士兵艾奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}}}